</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">Hashcat</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="mi">9700</span> <span class="nb">hash</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">u</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">w</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">–</span><span class="n">O</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="mi">5</span> <span class="n">位小写</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">大写</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">数字</span><span class="o">+</span><span class="n">特殊字符破解</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">Hashcat</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">m</span> <span class="mi">9700</span> <span class="nb">hash</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="mi">3</span> <span class="err">?</span><span class="n">b</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">b</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">b</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">b</span><span class="err">?</span><span class="n">b</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="n">w</span> <span class="mi">3</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><blockquote>
<p>破解时采取先易后难的原则，建议如下：</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>使用 1-8 位数字进行破解。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>使用 1-8 位小写字母进行破解。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>使用 1-8 位大写字母进行破解。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>使用 1-8位混合大小写+数字+特殊字符进行破解。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>利用收集的公开字典进行破解。</p>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
]]></content:encoded>
