<p>
<div class="post-img-view">
    <a data-fancybox="gallery" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192259208.png">
        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/yuexuan521/image/20251228192259208.png" 
             alt="" 
              
